  StartingLines:
  - You don't have to do anything yet.
  - "But if something good happened today \u2014 even something small \u2014 you
    could tell me about it."
  - That's all.
  FinishedLines:
  - Thanks. The plants and I enjoyed listening to you.
  ContinueLines:
  - There are more plants inside the greenhouse.
  - They don't all grow from the same things.
  - Why don't you look around?
  - You might find one that wants to hear something from you.
